---
import SwissLayout from '../../layouts/SwissLayout.astro';
import { ANALYTICS_STORAGE_MONTHS } from '@gopaylocal/shared/constants';
---

<SwissLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — GoPayLocal"
  description="GoPayLocal privacy policy. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data."
>
  <section class="py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[34rem] px-6">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <p class="inline-block bg-accent-500 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
          Legal
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-text-primary">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-muted">
          Last updated: November 21, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            GoPayLocal ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting your
            privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose,
            and safeguard your information when you use our service.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">
            2. Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            We collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you
            create an account, configure your settings, or contact us for
            support. When you sign in to the dashboard, we store the IP address
            and browser user agent of that sign-in with your session. We use
            them to protect accounts and the service against abuse and
            attacks.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            When a visitor loads a website that uses our script, we use the
            visitor's IP address to work out their country, to detect VPNs and
            proxies, and to limit abusive traffic. We do not store visitors'
            IP addresses. Our script keeps a random identifier in the
            visitor's browser so that a visitor in an A/B test keeps seeing
            the same variant; we do not store it on our servers. What we store
            are counts per country and day: banner impressions, clicks, code
            copies and redemptions.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            When a discount code is redeemed, your payment provider notifies
            us. We keep the code and the order's amounts, not who bought. A
            notification we cannot process right away is kept for about three
            days so we can retry, and its contents are then discarded.
            Payments for our own paid plans are handled by our payment
            processor, Dodo Payments. We never see or store card numbers; we
            keep the subscription and billing records they send us.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">
            3. How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            We use the information we collect to provide, maintain, and improve
            our services; to determine appropriate PPP discounts based on
            visitor location; to detect and prevent fraud (e.g., VPN detection);
            to send you technical notices and support messages; and to comply
            with legal obligations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">4. Data Retention</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            We retain your account information for as long as your account is
            active. Analytics data and API-call counts are deleted after
            {ANALYTICS_STORAGE_MONTHS} months. A dashboard session, with its IP
            address and user agent, is deleted when you sign out, or within
            about two days after it expires. You may request deletion of your
            data at any time by contacting us.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">5. Data Security</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to
            protect your personal data against unauthorized access, alteration,
            disclosure, or destruction.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Depending on your location, you may have certain rights regarding
            your personal data, including the right to access, correct, delete,
            or export your data. To exercise these rights, please contact us at
            support@gopaylocal.com.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">7. Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
            us at
            <a
              href="mailto:support@gopaylocal.com"
              class="text-accent-text hover:text-text-primary underline"
              >support@gopaylocal.com</a
            >.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SwissLayout>
